<view class="detail-page">
  <view class="detail-header"><view class="back-button pressable" bindtap="goBack"><image src="/assets/icons/chevron-left.png" /></view><view><view class="detail-title">行程详情</view><view class="detail-caption">轨迹与能耗分析</view></view><view class="wechat-capsule-space"></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="detail-map surface skeleton"></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="surface empty-state"><view class="empty-title">无法加载行程</view><view class="empty-copy">{{error}}</view></view>
  <block wx:elif="{{trip}}">
    <view wx:if="{{trip.route}}" class="detail-map surface">
      <map class="route-map" latitude="{{trip.route.center.latitude}}" longitude="{{trip.route.center.longitude}}" scale="12" markers="{{trip.route.markers}}" polyline="{{trip.route.polyline}}" enable-scroll="{{true}}" />
    </view>
    <view wx:else class="surface route-unavailable"><view class="empty-title">本次行程没有轨迹</view><view class="empty-copy">只展示车机实际记录的定位点，不补画路线。</view></view>
    <view class="route-title surface"><view class="route-point start"></view><view><view>{{trip.startName}}</view><text>{{trip.time}} 出发</text></view><view class="route-divider"></view><view class="route-point end"></view><view><view>{{trip.endName}}</view><text>{{trip.durationMinutes}}分钟后到达</text></view></view>
    <view class="section-heading"><view class="section-title">本次行程</view></view>
    <view class="metric-grid">
      <view class="metric surface blue"><text>{{trip.distanceKm}}</text><text>km</text><view>行驶距离</view></view>
      <view class="metric surface green"><text>{{trip.durationMinutes}}</text><text>分钟</text><view>行驶时长</view></view>
      <view class="metric surface yellow"><text>{{trip.consumption}}</text><text>kWh/100km</text><view>平均能耗</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="data-note surface"><image src="/assets/icons/info-blue.png" /><text>轨迹与能耗来自车机本地记录。定位点过少时只显示起点和终点，不补画虚假路线。</text></view>
  </block>
</view>
